  "schedule": "Cold first contact runs from adding the friend through the first 128-byte chat form send, receiver decryption and sender receipt. Next, the sender submits ten 128-byte ASCII messages via the chat form on the same confirmed chain with the receiver disconnected. On reconnection the receiver polls once and the sender polls once. Automatic five-second polls are suppressed for repeatability. CORS preflight cache is browser-managed across each group's cold and warm phases.",
